  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening food security for conflict-affected communities in Deir Ez Zor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will reach a total of 54,350 direct beneficiaries from the target communities will benefit from improved access to more nutritious agricultural products and increased sources of income through increased agricultural yields made possible by trainings, input and technology distributions, and light rehabilitation of facilities such as irrigation infrastructure and bakeries.</narrative>
  </description>
